Ajouter le format des exemples suivants
<< eof < Makefile
< infile cat > out


| Precedence | Operator | Meaning     |      |            |
| ---------- | -------- | ----------- | ---- | ---------- |
| Highest    | \`       | \`          | Pipe |            |
| Middle     | `&&`     | Logical AND |      |            |
| Lowest     | \`       |             | \`   | Logical OR |


`cat file.txt | grep "hello" && echo "Match found" || echo "No match"`

is the same as : ((cat file.txt | grep "hello") && echo "Match found") || echo "No match"

            ||
           /  \
         &&   echo "No match"
        /  \
   PIPE     echo "Match found"
   /   \
cat    grep "hello"

